flowchart TB
  subgraph Shared[Shared portable layer]
    M[Manifesto: why]
    P[Principles: invariants]
    T[Protocol: compatibility description]
  end
  subgraph Local[Independent local layers]
    C1[Community A\nlocal rules + tools]
    C2[Community B\nlocal rules + tools]
    C3[Community C\nlocal rules + tools]
  end
  subgraph Enablement[Activation and replication]
    CH[Challenge]
    LK[Launch kit]
  end
  M --> P --> T
  T --> C1
  T --> C2
  T --> C3
  CH --> LK --> C1
  LK --> C2
  LK --> C3
  C1 -. fork / adapt .-> C2
  C2 -. fork / adapt .-> C3
